    "legal.about.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReelSpan\nExplore movies through place and time.\n\nNo account · One-time purchase · Local movie database · Apple Maps spatial interface."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReelSpan\n通过地点与时间发现电影。\n\n免登录 · 一次买断 · 本地电影数据库 · Apple 地图空间界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.about.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.help.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use this area in the production app for FAQ, data-correction reports and support contact information. A useful data report should include the movie title, selected place/year and the incorrect story time or narrative location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正式版本可在这里提供常见问题、数据纠错和支持联系方式。有效的数据纠错报告应包含电影名称、所选地点/年份以及错误的故事时间或地点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.help.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Help & Feedback"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮助与反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.licenses.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current MVP uses Apple system frameworks including SwiftUI, MapKit, StoreKit, Foundation and SQLite supplied by the platform SDK. No third-party Swift package is required by this project skeleton."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前 MVP 使用平台 SDK 提供的 Apple 系统框架，包括 SwiftUI、MapKit、StoreKit、Foundation 和 SQLite。本项目骨架不依赖第三方 Swift Package。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.licenses.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Source Licenses"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源许可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.privacy.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReelSpan is designed without an account. Movie browsing, story-time filtering, location matching and favorites are processed locally on the device.\n\nLocation\nThe MVP does not require continuous location access. Place search and map interactions use Apple Maps. The app does not keep a history of precise locations by default.\n\nLocal data\nFavorites, preferences and downloaded image files remain on this device. Removing the app removes these local files unless iOS restores them from a device backup.\n\nApple services\nApple Maps and App Store purchases are Apple services and are governed by Apple's policies.\n\nAnalytics\nThe MVP does not include a third-party behavioral analytics SDK."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReelSpan 无需注册账户。电影浏览、故事时间筛选、地点匹配和收藏均在设备本地处理。\n\n地点\nMVP 不需要持续获取位置权限。地点搜索和地图交互使用 Apple 地图。默认不保存精确地点历史。\n\n本地数据\n收藏、偏好和下载的图片文件保存在本机。删除 App 会删除这些本地文件，除非 iOS 从设备备份中恢复。\n\nApple 服务\nApple 地图和 App Store 购买属于 Apple 服务，并受 Apple 自身政策约束。\n\n分析\nMVP 不包含第三方行为分析 SDK。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.privacy.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy Policy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私政策"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.sources.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wikidata\nThe core knowledge graph aligns movie identities, narrative locations (P840), set-in-period statements (P2408), location hierarchy and cross-database identifiers. The production ETL retains source QIDs and provenance.\n\nTMDB\nThe production dataset can enrich movies with localized titles and overviews, release information, runtime, genres, director, cast, vote average/count and licensed image references.\n\nCurated normalization\nReelSpan converts source periods into independent inclusive time ranges and precomputes location ancestors. Contemporary titles are normalized to the release decade under the current product rule."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wikidata\n核心知识图谱用于对齐电影身份、故事地点（P840）、故事时期（P2408）、地点层级和跨数据库 ID。生产 ETL 会保留来源 QID 和数据来源信息。\n\nTMDB\n生产数据可补充多语言片名与简介、上映信息、时长、类型、导演、演员、评分/评分人数以及经许可的图片引用。\n\n整理与归一化\nReelSpan 将来源时期转换为相互独立且包含端点的时间区间，并预计算地点上级关系。按当前产品规则，当代作品按上映年份所在十年归一化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.sources.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data Sources"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.terms.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReelSpan provides movie discovery based on place and story time. Story locations and time ranges may be incomplete or approximate because source metadata varies by title.\n\nA one-time Full Access purchase, when enabled, is processed by the App Store. Restore Purchase uses StoreKit and your App Store account; ReelSpan does not create a separate account.\n\nMovie metadata, posters and backdrops remain the property of their respective rights holders and data licensors. The app license does not transfer ownership of third-party content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReelSpan 根据地点和故事时间提供电影发现功能。由于不同作品的来源元数据完整度不同，故事地点和时间范围可能存在缺失或近似。\n\n启用后，一次性完整功能购买由 App Store 处理。恢复购买使用 StoreKit 和你的 App Store 账户；ReelSpan 不创建独立账户。\n\n电影元数据、海报和背景图的权利仍属于各自权利人和数据许可方。购买 App 不会转移任何第三方内容的所有权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.terms.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terms of Use"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用条款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "legal.tmdb.body": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.\n\nThe production release must follow the exact attribution, logo, image and commercial-use requirements in the TMDB agreement applicable to the project at release time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本产品使用 TMDB API，但未得到 TMDB 的背书或认证。\n\n正式发布版本必须遵守项目发布时适用的 TMDB 协议中关于归因、Logo、图片及商业使用的具体要求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
